<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1921</h1><p class="ref-lede">1921 in world history: 38 events, 23 births, 21 deaths, 2 works, 17 states founded and 12 that came to an end. 747 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
