<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/principality-of-liechtenstein"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Principality%20of%20Liechtenstein.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Principality of Liechtenstein</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A new constitution shares power between prince and people</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kingdom-of-yugoslavia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kingdom%20of%20Yugoslavia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kingdom of Yugoslavia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The centralist Vidovdan Constitution is adopted</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/government/one-party-state"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/One-party%20state.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>One-party state</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Tenth Congress of the Russian Communist Party bans factions as the last rival parties are suppressed</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/culture/yangshao-culture"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Yangshao%20culture.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Yangshao culture</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Johan Gunnar Andersson discovers the Yangshao site in western Henan, which gives the culture its name</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/may-fourth-movement"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/May%20Fourth%20Movement.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>May Fourth Movement</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Chen Duxiu and Li Dazhao are among the founders of the Chinese Communist Party</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/harlem-renaissance"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Harlem%20Renaissance.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Harlem Renaissance</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Shuffle Along brings an African-American musical and jazz to Broadway</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kingdom-of-romania"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kingdom%20of%20Romania.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kingdom of Romania</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A land reform redistributes land to the peasants but does little to improve farming</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/armenian-ssr"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Armenian%20SSR.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Armenian SSR</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Armenians rise against the Revkom in February; the Treaties of Moscow and Kars leave Kars, Ardahan and Surmalu to Turkey, and in July Nagorno-Karabakh is given to Soviet Azerbaijan</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kingdom-of-hungary-1920-1946"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kingdom%20of%20Hungary%20(1920-1946).png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kingdom of Hungary (1920-1946)</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Charles IV fails to retake the throne, and the Diet abolishes the House of Habsburg's rights to it</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/second-polish-republic"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Second%20Polish%20Republic.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Second Polish Republic</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Polish–Soviet War, fought since 1919, ends in a decisive Polish victory</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/mustafa-kemal-ataturk"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Mustafa%20Kemal%20Atat%C3%BCrk.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Mustafa Kemal Atatürk</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">As commander in chief defeats the Greek army at the Battle of the Sakarya and is made field marshal and Gazi</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/mao-zedong"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Mao%20Zedong.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Mao Zedong</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">He is one of 13 delegates at the first congress of the Chinese Communist Party in Shanghai</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/jawaharlal-nehru"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Jawaharlal%20Nehru.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Jawaharlal Nehru</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">He is imprisoned for anti-government activity, the first of eight detentions up to 1945</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/battle/battle-of-warsaw-1920"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Battle%20of%20Warsaw%20(1920).png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Battle of Warsaw (1920)</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Treaty of Riga, signed on 18 March, ends hostilities</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/shanghai"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Shanghai.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Shanghai</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Chinese Communist Party is founded in the French Concession</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/gutenberg-bible"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Gutenberg%20Bible.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Gutenberg Bible</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The New York dealer Gabriel Wells dismantles a damaged copy and sells its leaves as the Noble Fragments</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/dream-of-the-red-chamber"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Dream%20of%20the%20Red%20Chamber.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Dream of the Red Chamber</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Hu Shih publishes Studies on A Dream of the Red Chamber, arguing that Gao E wrote the last 40 chapters</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/vladimir-lenin"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Vladimir%20Lenin.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Vladimir Lenin</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Lenin introduces the New Economic Policy and bans factions within the party</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/yaa-asantewaa"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Yaa%20Asantewaa.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Yaa Asantewaa</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">She dies in exile in the Seychelles</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/rabindranath-tagore"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Rabindranath%20Tagore.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Rabindranath Tagore</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Visva-Bharati is inaugurated three years after its foundation stone was laid</span></li></ul></section>
